 'PDF discussion: "two-sided characterisation ... (Section 2.5)? What is the arithmetical level ... (Section 2.5)?"; PDF line ~1621 "Over the whole cycle these bounds sum to at most about 2N bits (Section 6.3)"; app-verification line 176 notes the same defect.',
